-- s 37 illus (b): the joint jailors who each omit to feed Z: both guilty.
#ASSERT `commits that offence within section 37` (`Cooperation Facts` WITH `the offence is committed by means of several acts` IS TRUE, `intentionally cooperates in the commission of that offence` IS TRUE, `by doing any one of those acts, singly or jointly with any other person` IS TRUE)
-- s 37 illus (c): A, dismissed, did not cooperate with his successor B; A is
-- not guilty of the murder under s 37 (he is guilty only of an attempt).
#ASSERT NOT `commits that offence within section 37` (`Cooperation Facts` WITH `the offence is committed by means of several acts` IS TRUE, `intentionally cooperates in the commission of that offence` IS FALSE, `by doing any one of those acts, singly or jointly with any other person` IS TRUE)

§§ `s 40 - "offence"`

