    `punishable under that other law with imprisonment for a term of 6 months or upwards` IS TRUE
`punishable only under another law, with 3 months` MEANS `Offence Facts` WITH
    `made punishable by this Code` IS FALSE
    `punishable under any other written law for the time being in force` IS TRUE
    `punishable under that other law with imprisonment for a term of 6 months or upwards` IS FALSE

